.SH NAME
centcom\-join \- join a shared session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B centcom join <invite link | watch\-only link | session id> [\-\-name <name>]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Joins a session somebody shared with you and prints what their agent does. You can ask it for things (the host decides what runs); a watch\-only link needs no account.
